  "slug": "syncora-connector-version-support",
  "title": "How to Record Your Syncora Connector Version for Support",
  "description": "Collect the connector version, Windows PC and sync details that help support reproduce a problem.",
  "category": "Setup",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Find the version on the affected PC",
      "body": "Use the Windows computer where the connector experienced the problem. Note the version displayed if it is visible. Otherwise, check Windows Installed Apps or the installer filename. Record which source you used since a downloaded installer can be newer than the installed copy."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Tie the version to one incident",
      "body": "Write down the time and timezone of the failed run, the company you were syncing and the exact message. For example, record that a sync stopped at 10:42 IST after selecting the trading company. This gives support a specific run to investigate."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Send just enough evidence",
      "body": "Attach a screenshot that shows the error and version. Mask customer details and hide account credentials. If several PCs run a connector, identify the affected PC so the support team can tell which copy and version your report describes."
    }
  ],
  "relatedPaths": [
    "/guides/tallyprime-setup",
    "/product-overview"
  ]
}
